      "created": 1791807067420,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nnow we are going to build the index using bm25 we will explain it in the next steps:\n\n----->: loop through the chunks and tokenize it by (bm25.tokenize)\n----->: create an object from BM25 and use its index() func to \n        prepares the BM25 index. Later, when you search for a query\n        BM25 calculates a relevance score for each retrieved chunk.\n------>: we use save func to save the index as binary \n  ",
      "fontSize": 19.714285714285683,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nnow we are going to build the index using bm25 we will explain it in the next steps:\n\n----->: loop through the chunks and tokenize it by (bm25.tokenize)\n----->: create an object from BM25 and use its index() func to \n        prepares the BM25 index. Later, when you search for a query\n        BM25 calculates a relevance score for each retrieved chunk.\n------>: we use save func to save the index as binary \n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
